        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&#10;• Network is flat. Seven cloud-connected Amazon devices share a subnet with the workstation —&#10;   segmentation is the highest-priority planned change, blocked on AP VLAN support in AP mode.&#10;• All client DNS forced to Unbound via destination NAT on port 53.&#10;• Management interface bound to LAN only; SSH disabled; ISP gateway blocked outbound.&#10;• Public addressing, MAC addresses, SSIDs and firewall rule detail deliberately omitted." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="800" width="540" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

